<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Lightning Storm</h1>
<p>Sphere: Electricity Sphere
Spell Tier: 4
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 160)
Mana: 40
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast lightning storm &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast lightning storm</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The air crackles as the caster gestures and snarls 'Thudas electra!', and 
a thunderhead forms over the target and strikes with bolts of lightning. 
It is the strongest of the sorcerer's lightning spells: the better your 
magic and your electricity sphere, the harder it strikes. It does best 
against clothes and leather and less well against chain and plate, and a 
shield is no use against it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting, 
and no free hands are needed. It is also found on wands, staffs and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
